  "description": "Marcos was once a successful writer of children's books. His goal for years has been to conclude his masterpiece novel. But the lack of social interaction, his excessive ambitions and the influence of a narcotic plant he cultivates (and sells) to live, does not help him. He is about to quit when his friend Walter proposes an alternative way: Marcos has to live a more intense life. And describe it, like so many renowned writers.",
